.TH VHANGUP 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
vhangup \- virtually hangs up the calling process's controlling terminal; typically requires cap_sys_tty_config
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <unistd.h>
.B int vhangup(void);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Virtually hangs up the calling process's controlling terminal; typically requires CAP_SYS_TTY_CONFIG.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR vhangup (2)
